B.ap4=new A.jm("roles","Roles and permissions","Groups have admins and members. Admins manage people and files; members read and add.",B.KL,B.bjF,B.be9)
B.ao2=new A.d3("Adding","Open a group \u2192 Add a group file, or Send a file to the group. Everyone in the group can read it.",!1)
B.aoL=new A.d3("Reading","Tap a file to open it in the protected viewer. Chat \u2192 All files lists every file from your groups.",!1)
B.aoP=new A.d3("Touch to reveal","The page stays blurred until you hold your finger on it, which stops the person behind you. Turn it off in Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security.",!1)
B.aoG=new A.d3("What this does not do","Group files are not end-to-end encrypted. They are stored on our server and access is checked by database rules. For that, send a One open link instead: it is encrypted on your phone.",!0)
B.biM=s([B.ao2,B.aoL,B.aoP,B.aoG],t.eH)
B.bcg=s(["file","upload","pdf","vault","all files","viewer","study desk"],t.s)
B.aoT=new A.jm("secure-documents","Files in groups","Files in a group open in the protected viewer, marked with the reader\u2019s name.",B.cL,B.biM,B.bcg)
B.ao3=new A.d3("Watermarks","A file someone shares with you has a small grey line at the foot of each page: your name, part of your email, and the time you opened it. A photo that shows the line points back to you. Your own files stay clean; turn on Mark my own screen in Settings if you want them marked too.",!1)
B.aom=new A.d3("After a capture attempt","If someone tries to print, copy, press PrintScreen or record the screen, their name and email cover the page for the rest of that visit.",!1)
B.anY=new A.d3("Screenshot blocking is Android-only","On Android the app blocks screenshots and screen recording, and records the attempt. On the web and on iOS nothing can stop a screenshot. There, the watermark and the activity log protect you.",!0)
B.ao7=new A.d3("A camera always wins","No app can stop someone photographing their screen with another phone. These controls tell you who, after the fact.",!0)
B.aRq=s([B.ao3,B.aom,B.anY,B.ao7],t.eH)
B.biD=s(["watermark","screenshot","screen record","capture","leak"],t.s)
B.ap5=new A.jm("watermarking","Watermarks and screenshots","Other people\u2019s files carry your name in the page margin, and on Android screenshots are blocked.",B.B1,B.aRq,B.biD)
B.apX=new A.aO(61697,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aoo=new A.d3("What is recorded","Joins and leaves, files added, renamed, deleted and opened, screenshot attempts, and admin actions. It records who and when, never what a file says.",!1)
B.aoj=new A.d3("Visible to everyone in the group","Members see what admins do as easily as admins see members. Nobody gets a private log.",!1)
B.anZ=new A.d3("Tamper evidence","Entries are chained, so removing or editing one breaks the chain. Nothing can be quietly taken back, including by admins.",!1)
B.bkm=s([B.aoo,B.aoj,B.anZ],t.eH)
B.blN=s(["audit","log","activity","history","who opened","tamper","security alerts"],t.s)
B.ap2=new A.jm("audit-log","Activity","A record of what happened in your groups and on your account. Settings \u2192 Activity.",B.apX,B.bkm,B.blN)
B.aq0=new A.aO(62005,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ao6=new A.d3("What you can hear about","Invites and join requests, role changes, admin actions that affect you, files added to your groups, a one-open link you sent being opened, and security alerts (your account was locked, or a screen connected to it). Turn each one off in Settings \u2192 Notifications.",!1)
B.aoF=new A.d3("Nothing sensitive on the lock screen","A notification names the group and what kind of thing happened, never a file\u2019s name or what it says.",!1)
B.ao9=new A.d3("If you said no to the permission","Android asks once. Everything still shows under the bell in the app, and Settings \u2192 Notifications has a button to open the system setting.",!1)
B.bbF=s([B.ao6,B.aoF,B.ao9],t.eH)
B.aRr=s(["push","alert","permission","mute","lock screen","privacy"],t.s)
B.ap0=new A.jm("notifications","Notifications","Hear when something you care about happens, without details on your lock screen.",B.aq0,B.bbF,B.aRr)
B.apz=new A.aO(58519,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aoH=new A.d3("Signing in","New accounts use Google. If you made your account with email, GitHub or a phone number, tap Other ways to sign in.",!1)
B.ao_=new A.d3("What is stored","Your email, display name and avatar. Files you add to groups. Activity entries for things you did. Your own chat is kept in your Google Drive, not on our server.",!1)
B.aoe=new A.d3("Who can see your email","Members of your groups. Activity names people by email, which is what makes it useful.",!0)
B.aoA=new A.d3("Deleting your account","Your picture \u2192 Settings \u2192 Danger zone \u2192 Delete account. It removes your profile, your group memberships, every file you added (in every group) and the activity records of what you did. It can\u2019t be undone. Your own chat stays in your Google Drive.",!1)
