B.aon=new A.d3('"This link has already been opened"',"A One open link is gone after the first open. Ask for a new one. If you never opened it, assume something else did.",!1)
B.aoJ=new A.d3('"This invite has expired or been revoked"',"Invite links can expire, have a limit, or be revoked by an admin. Ask for a new one.",!1)
B.aob=new A.d3("A file will not open","Usually your access was removed or the file was deleted. Pull down to refresh.",!1)
B.aow=new A.d3("The app says it is offline","Groups, files, your own chat and sending need a connection. Settings \u2192 Connection check shows whether this phone can reach NO SUS.",!1)
B.aou=new A.d3("Asked to sign in again","If unusual security signals show up on your account, the app asks you to sign in again. Signing back in clears it once the risk has passed.",!1)
